Original research source and measurements
=========================================

Computational Periscopy with an Ordinary Digital Camera
Charles Saunders, John Murray-Bruce and Vivek K Goyal
Nature 565, 472–475 (2019), DOI: 10.1038/s41586-018-0868-6

Original repository:
https://github.com/Computational-Periscopy/Ordinary-Camera
Verified source version: 6b088a3abff8a5854bbd1419e8f05727f487a94e
Authors' project page:
https://www.vivekgoyal.org/computational-periscopy.htm

CornerVision retains 165 original computational and data files with identical
Git blob identities. The original author headers remain in those files.
This adaptation adds corner_vision.m, geometry smoke checks, documentation
and artwork; it does not claim authorship of the original research algorithm
or measurements.

No upstream license file is present at the verified source version. The MIT
license in this repository covers only the added CornerVision material and
does not grant an additional license for the original research files.
